{"video":"g-iXx179_h4","lines":[{"t":[0,3.9],"en":"Do you not want to be seen with me?"},{"t":[4.4,6.1],"en":"What? No, of course I do."},{"t":[6.2,7],"en":"Are they gone?"},{"t":[8.6,11.8],"en":"No, they're still here, but I think I'm about to leave."},{"t":[12,13.2],"en":"What? No, no, wait."},{"t":[15,16.4],"en":"You're right. This is stupid."},{"t":[17.1,18.8],"en":"Who cares what people think?"},{"t":[18.9,20.6],"en":"I mean, we like each other, right?"},{"t":[20.9,22.1],"en":"There's nothing wrong with that."},{"t":[23.6,24.2],"en":"Come on."},{"t":[29,29.4],"en":"Bert?"},{"t":[30,31.4],"en":"Lydia? Mel?"},{"t":[33.2,34.3],"en":"This is Elizabeth."},{"t":[34.9,35.4],"en":"Hi."},{"t":[35.8,38.6],"en":"Aren't you in my popular culture class?"},{"t":[38.7,39.3],"en":"That's right, Lydia."},{"t":[39.7,42.5],"en":"Elizabeth here is a student, and we're dating."},{"t":[43.2,44.9],"en":"And you may frown upon that,"},{"t":[45.3,47.8],"en":"but we're not going to hide it anymore."},{"t":[50.4,52.2],"en":"You are so fired."},{"t":[54.4,54.9],"en":"What?"},{"t":[55.3,56.4],"en":"They're going to fire you."},{"t":[56.4,58.7],"en":"You can't date a student. It's against the rules."},{"t":[71.5,71.8],"en":"I mean..."}]}
